::: article id=art-appeal
::: section id=sec-appeal
## Appeal

An appeal must be lodged within ten days. The form below is submitted only when the reader submits it; the document has no way to cause a request on its own.

::: form action=appeals/submit method=post
### Lodge an appeal

Fields marked required must be completed.

::: field label="Name of appellant" name=appellant required=true
::: field-text value=""
:::
:::

::: field label="Grounds for appeal" name=grounds required=true
::: field-text multiline=true value=""
:::
:::

::: field label="Legal basis" name=basis required=false
::: field-choice multiple=false
::: field-option selected=true value=procedure
::: text v="Procedural irregularity"
:::
:::

::: field-option value=criteria
::: text v="Misapplication of award criteria"
